00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:30.920
So that's that's kind of how Autobot started was it was this effort

346
00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:34.720
to kind of clear off the lower hanging fruit that doesn't require

347
00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:37.440
a developer to supervise and tell the robot

